<title>USA: Morgan Stanley adds to share buyback budget.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley adds to share buyback budget.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of an additional $400 million of common stock.</p>
<p>The new authorization, when combined with th existing unused budget of about $235 million, brings Morgan Stanley's total repurchase authority to about $635 million.</p>
<p>The company said any repurchases would be subject to market conditions and other considerations.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it bought back about $507 million of stock during fiscal 1996 and about $103 million in 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
